<title>USA: American CinemaStores ends merger deal.</title>
<headline>American CinemaStores ends merger deal.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American CinemaStores Inc said Thursday it has mutually agreed to terminate its proposed merger with Superior Panoramic Handprints Inc.</p>
<p>American CinemaStores said in a statement the principal reason behind the decision to terminate was an inability to finance the merger.</p>
</text>
